  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Circular Economy &amp; Water visit Mexico to the Netherlands 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study visit aims to provide the Mexican Ministry of Environment &amp; Natural Resources (SEMARNAT) and the Ministry of Water (Conagua) with information and connections to Circular Economy and water solutions that Dutch companies have to offer, based on the needs of the Tula river restauration and Circular Economy Park projects.The goal of this visit is to explore Circular Economy &amp; Water Management solutions and share knowledge on policy and innovations. It will also promote Dutch companies to offer their solutions and services in these areas.</narrative>
  </description>
